WEBVTT

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:30.078
And why does sex make babies,

00:00:30.102 --> 00:00:32.712
and babies spell erotic
disaster in couples?

00:00:32.736 --> 00:00:34.343
(Laughter)

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.545
It's kind of the fatal
erotic blow, isn't it?

00:00:37.014 --> 00:00:39.327
And when you love, how does it feel?

00:00:39.351 --> 00:00:41.831
And when you desire, how is it different?

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:44.148
These are some of the questions

00:00:44.172 --> 00:00:49.638
that are at the center of my exploration
on the nature of erotic desire

00:00:49.662 --> 00:00:53.086
and its concomitant
dilemmas in modern love.

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.060
So I travel the globe,

00:00:55.084 --> 00:01:00.443
and what I'm noticing is that everywhere
